    "body": "The physical joint is already accepted. The installed repair resets the offset solver whenever OffsetX/Y/Z changes and uses the current Rockstar ped-owner joint form. Test walking, a fall, mounting, and several outfits after moving one offset in both directions; the lantern must swing and the chosen position must stay. The rigid joint cannot guarantee collision against every animated leg or coat, so a no-clearance result remains an engine limit rather than a cloth-rig claim.",
